---
/* FirstSection.astro - Ajuste para Espaciado Equitativo Global */
---

<section
  class="first-section relative min-h-screen w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center overflow-hidden bg-transparent"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div
      class="absolute top-[10%] -left-[5%] w-[60%] h-[60%] bg-[#A67E5B]/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full opacity-50"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-[5%] -right-[10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] bg-[#8C3730]/10 blur-[130px] rounded-full mix-blend-overlay"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] bg-[url('https://grainy-gradients.vercel.app/noise.svg')]"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1600px] w-full relative z-10">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-20 items-center"
    >
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
        <img
          src="/GreedFall/GreedFallTheDyingWorld_mono_white.png"
          alt="GreedFall Logo"
          class="w-auto h-auto max-w-[90%] md:max-w-md lg:max-w-[380px] xl:max-w-xl mb-6 md:mb-10 object-contain drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(166,126,91,0.2)] relative"
        />

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start relative">
          <h2
            class="font-cinzel text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-6xl font-bold text-[#F2E6D8] leading-tight mb-4 md:mb-8"
          >
            Un Mundo <span class="text-[#F2865E]">Forjado</span> por la Magia y el
            Acero
          </h2>

          <div
            class="space-y-4 md:space-y-6 text-[#F2E6D8]/80 font-serif text-sm md:text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 border-[#A67E5B]/20 pl-6 lg:pl-8"
          >
            <p>
              Vuelve al universo de GreedFall en una nueva y emocionante
              aventura en la que cada decisión tiene consecuencias.
            </p>
            <p>
              Arrancado de tu isla, viajarás por el Viejo Continente, devastado
              por la guerra y las enfermedades, forjando alianzas y luchando
              para recuperar tu libertad.
            </p>
            <p
              class="not-italic font-sans text-[10px] md:text-xs lg:text-sm tracking-wide text-[#A67E5B] uppercase opacity-90 leading-tight"
            >
              Tras un periodo de Early Access que permitió reunir a miles de
              fans y perfeccionar el juego al máximo, la aventura completa
              comienza ahora en consolas y PC.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 md:mt-10 h-px w-24 md:w-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#A67E5B] to-transparent"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 w-full relative">
        <div
          class="group relative w-full max-w-full md:max-w-[700px] lg:max-w-full mx-auto lg:ml-auto"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#A67E5B]/40 via-[#F2865E]/20 to-[#A67E5B]/40 rounded-sm blur-[2px] opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-700"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative bg-[#0D0D0D] p-1 border border-[#A67E5B]/30 shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] w-full"
          >
            <div class="video-wrapper relative aspect-video overflow-hidden">
              <video
                autoplay
                muted
                loop
                playsinline
                class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[0.2] group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-1000"
              >
                <source src="/GreedFall/video_promo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1D2F40]/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
              >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-center mt-8">
    <a
      href="#buy-now"
      class="group relative px-8 py-3 overflow-hidden border border-[#A67E5B]/40 bg-[#1D2F40]/40 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500 block"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#A67E5B]/5 group-hover:bg-[#A67E5B]/20 transition-colors"
      >
      </div>

      <span
        class="relative z-10 text-[#F2E6D8] font-cinzel text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase"
      >
        Compra ya
      </span>

      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-[#A67E5B]"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-[#A67E5B]"
      >
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .first-section {
    contain: paint;
  }

  .video-wrapper {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
</style>
